# Workflow Error

**Error:** invalid workflow step type

Step step1 of workflow invalid-step-type uses unsupported type invalid. Registered step types: alert, archive, atmos, cancel, cast, choose, clear, confirm, container, emulator, env, exec, exit, file, filter, format, hint, http, input, join, junit, linebreak, log, markdown, matrix, pager, parallel, require, say, script, shell, sleep, spin, stage, store, style, table, test, tflint, title, toast, wait, wait-all, workdir, write.
